{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3f2a6b0-6e2a-4b3a-9d2a-7c2a5a1d0f01",
    "name": "Hospitality Ecosystem - Task Management API",
    "description": "Team, Task Category, and Task endpoints (App\\Http\\Controllers\\TeamController, TaskCategoryController, TaskController). Companion to docs/task-management-api-documentation.md.\n\n## How to run this\n\n1. Set the `base_url` and `api_key` collection variables (see Variables tab).\n2. Run **Auth > Register Admin + Hotel**, then **Auth > Login** — these set `token` and `hotel_id` for every other request automatically via test scripts.\n3. Run the **Team** folder top to bottom: Create Team sets `team_id` automatically.\n4. **Team > Add Member to Team** needs an existing `employee_user_id` (a user with `role: employee` who already belongs to this hotel). There is currently no API endpoint in this project that creates an employee user — `/api/register` only creates an `admin` plus a brand-new hotel. Seed an employee directly (e.g. `php artisan tinker` or a DB seeder) and paste their id into the `employee_user_id` collection variable before running that request, or skip it.\n5. Run the **Task Category** folder: Create Task Category sets `task_category_id` automatically, using the `team_id` from step 3.\n6. Run the **Task** folder: Create Task sets `task_id` automatically, using both `team_id` and `task_category_id`.\n7. **Team > Delete Team** will fail with a 500 (DB foreign-key violation) if the team still has a member attached — remove members first, or skip it. See the doc's \"Delete a Team\" section.\n\nEvery request needs `X-API-KEY` and (except Register/Login) `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` — both are pre-filled on every request in this collection from collection variables.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_password", "value": "Password123!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "hotel_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "team_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "employee_user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "task_category_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "task_id", "value": "" , "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Not part of the task-management APIs themselves, but every request below needs a bearer token from these two calls first. See docs/auth-api-documentation.md for full details.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Admin + Hotel",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_email', 'admin.' + Date.now() + '@example.com');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.body && json.body.hotel) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('hotel_id', json.body.hotel.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Grand Harbor Admin\",\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{admin_password}}\",\n  \"hotel\": {\n    \"name\": \"Grand Harbor Hotel\",\n    \"city\": \"Cairo\",\n    \"country_code\": \"EG\",\n    \"currency\": \"USD\",\n    \"timezone\": \"UTC\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.body) {",
                  "    if (json.body.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.body.token);",
                  "    if (json.body.user && json.body.user.hotel && json.body.user.hotel.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('hotel_id', json.body.user.hotel.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Team",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Teams",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/team?per_page=15",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["team"],
              "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "15" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Team",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.body && json.body.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('team_id', json.body.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"hotel_id\": \"{{hotel_id}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Housekeeping\",\n  \"description\": \"Room cleaning and turndown\",\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/team",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["team"]
            },
            "description": "`hotel_id` is required by validation but always overwritten server-side with the caller's own hotel — see the doc."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Team",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/team/{{team_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["team", "{{team_id}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Team",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Housekeeping (Updated)\",\n  \"description\": \"Room cleaning, turndown, and linen management\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/team/{{team_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["team", "{{team_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Sending `hotel_id` here is silently ignored — a team can never be reassigned to a different hotel through this endpoint."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Member to Team",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{employee_user_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/team/{{team_id}}/members",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["team", "{{team_id}}", "members"]
            },
            "description": "`employee_user_id` must already exist, belong to this hotel, and have `role: employee` — set the `employee_user_id` collection variable manually before running this (see collection description). Returns 422 if the target user's role isn't `employee`, 403 if they belong to a different hotel."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Team",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/team/{{team_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["team", "{{team_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Fails with an unhandled 500 (foreign-key constraint violation) if the team still has a member attached — remove members first (there is no dedicated \"remove member\" endpoint in this API as of this writing)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Task Category",
      "description": "GET /api/task-category/{id} (show) is intentionally not included here — the route is registered but TaskCategoryController has no show() method, so it errors instead of returning 404. See the doc's Task Category section.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Task Categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task-category?per_page=15",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task-category"],
              "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "15" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Task Category",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.body && json.body.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('task_category_id', json.body.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"hotel_id\": \"{{hotel_id}}\",\n  \"team_id\": \"{{team_id}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Cleaning\",\n  \"description\": \"Routine room cleaning tasks\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task-category",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task-category"]
            },
            "description": "`team_id` is optional (a category can be hotel-wide instead), but if sent it must belong to the caller's own hotel."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Task Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cleaning (Updated)\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task-category/{{task_category_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task-category", "{{task_category_id}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Task Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task-category/{{task_category_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task-category", "{{task_category_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Hard delete. Any task referencing this category has task_category_id nulled automatically."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Task",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Tasks",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task?per_page=15",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task"],
              "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "15" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Task",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.body && json.body.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('task_id', json.body.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"hotel_id\": \"{{hotel_id}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Fix the AC in room 204\",\n  \"description\": \"Guest reported no cold air.\",\n  \"assigned_to_team_id\": \"{{team_id}}\",\n  \"task_category_id\": \"{{task_category_id}}\",\n  \"priority\": \"high\",\n  \"due_date\": \"2026-08-10T14:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task"]
            },
            "description": "If both assigned_to_team_id and task_category_id are set, the category's own team_id must exactly match assigned_to_team_id, or this returns 403. Filter the category picker by team_id client-side to avoid invalid combinations."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task/{{task_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task", "{{task_id}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task/{{task_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task", "{{task_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "status must be one of: pending, in_progress, completed, cancelled."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Task",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-KEY", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/task/{{task_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["task", "{{task_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Soft delete — sets deleted_at, does not remove the row."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
